==English==
{{wikipedia}}
{{wikipedia|partnership (cricket)}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|partner|ship|lang=en}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|partnerships}}

# The state of being [[associated]] with a [[partner]].
# An [[association]] of two or more people to [[conduct]] a [[business]],
# {{label|en|cricket}} The [[period]] when two specific [[batsmen]] are batting, from the fall of one [[wicket]] until the fall of the next; the [[number]] of [[run]]s [[score]]d during this period,

